msgstr ""

#: includes/class-rnrd-markdown.php:166
msgid "After the purge, RankReady's distinct Markdown URLs (/post-slug.md, /index.md) and Accept-header content negotiation both work through APO. Validators like AcceptMarkdown.com score 4/4."
